      <article class="resource" id="portal">
        <span class="card__icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-mobile-screen" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <div>
          <h2>Osmind Patient Portal</h2>
          <p>We use Osmind, a secure, HIPAA-compliant patient platform, for onboarding paperwork, video appointments, secure messaging with your provider, and billing.</p>
          <ul class="checklist">
            <li>After your first contact with us, you'll receive an email and text invitation from Osmind. Check your spam or promotions folder if you don't see it.</li>
            <li>Download the Osmind app from the App Store or Google Play and tap <strong>Activate</strong> to set your password.</li>
            <li>Prefer a computer? You can also log in from your web browser.</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="{{ site.portalUrl }}" class="btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Log in to the Patient Portal</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="resource" id="new-patients">
        <span class="card__icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-user-plus" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <div>
          <h2>New Patients</h2>
          <ol class="steps-list">
            <li><strong>Reach out.</strong> Book online through Osmind, or call or text {{ site.phone }}. We respond within one business day.</li>
            <li><strong>Complete onboarding.</strong> Fill out your onboarding paperwork in the Osmind patient app. Our admin will then help you schedule your first intake appointment.</li>
            <li><strong>Meet your provider.</strong> Your first appointment is a 60-minute comprehensive evaluation of your mental health history, current concerns, and treatment goals.</li>
          </ol>
          <p>We see patients age 8 and up who are located in Washington State at the time of their visit.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="resource" id="appointments">
        <span class="card__icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-video" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <div>
          <h2>Preparing for Your Virtual Appointment</h2>
          <ul class="checklist">
            <li>Use a smartphone, tablet, or computer with a camera, microphone, and a stable internet connection.</li>
            <li>Find a quiet, private space with good lighting, and make sure your device is charged.</li>
            <li>Have any relevant medical records or a list of your current medications ready.</li>
            <li>Join through the telemedicine link in your Osmind patient portal at your scheduled time.</li>
            <li>Want a support person to join? Let your provider know beforehand. You may need to complete a release of information form first.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="resource" id="refills">
        <span class="card__icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-prescription-bottle-medical" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <div>
          <h2>Prescription Refills &amp; Messages</h2>
          <p><strong>Refills:</strong> Please contact our office directly. Refills are typically processed within 48 hours. We do not refill prescriptions during weekends or holidays, so please plan ahead.</p>
          <p><strong>Questions between appointments:</strong> For non-urgent questions, message your provider through the secure messaging system in the Osmind patient portal. We respond within 1–2 business days.</p>
          <p class="note"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-exclamation" aria-hidden="true"></i> Portal messages are not monitored for emergencies. If you are experiencing a psychiatric emergency, call 911 or go to your nearest emergency room.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="resource" id="payment">
        <span class="card__icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-credit-card" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <div>
          <h2>Payment &amp; Insurance</h2>
          <div class="pay-grid">
            <div>
              <h3>Dr. Badeea Qureshi, MD</h3>
              <ul class="checklist">
                <li>Private pay</li>
                <li>Sliding scale available for those with financial hardship. Contact our office for the sliding scale form.</li>
                <li>FSA/HSA accepted</li>
                <li>Superbills provided after every visit to submit to your insurance for possible reimbursement</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3>Francis Agbotse, PMHNP</h3>
              <ul class="checklist">
                <li>Aetna</li>
                <li>Ambetter</li>
                <li>Coordinated Care (Medicare + Medicaid)</li>
                <li>Waitlist open for Cigna, Optum Behavioral Health, Premera Blue Cross, Regence BlueShield, TriWest, and First Choice Health</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p>Insurance coverage varies by plan. Learn <a href="/aetna-mental-health-provider-cost/">what to ask your insurance before your first appointment</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="resource" id="policies">
        <span class="card__icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-xmark" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <div>
          <h2>Cancellation Policy</h2>
          <ul class="checklist">
            <li>Cancel or reschedule with at least 48 hours' notice: no cancellation fee.</li>
            <li>Cancel with less than 48 hours' notice: 50% cancellation fee.</li>
            <li>No-show without notice: the full appointment amount is due.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="resource resource--crisis" id="crisis">
        <span class="card__icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-life-ring" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <div>
          <h2>Crisis Resources</h2>
          <p>Meaningful Psychiatry does not provide crisis or emergency care. If you or someone you know needs help right now:</p>
          <ul class="crisis-list">
            <li><strong>Emergency:</strong> Call <a href="tel:911">911</a> or go to your nearest emergency room</li>
            <li><strong>988 Suicide &amp; Crisis Lifeline:</strong> Call or text <a href="tel:988">988</a>, available 24/7</li>
            <li><strong>Crisis Text Line:</strong> Text HOME to <a href="sms:741741">741741</a></li>
            <li><strong>Washington Recovery Help Line</strong> (mental health, substance use, and problem gambling): <a href="tel:18667891511">1-866-789-1511</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>

